  "releaseNotes": "Kazo OS 3.3.0, changes for app developers:\n- Installed apps find the .NET methods they need. The published Kazo OS keeps the whole .NET core library, so an app installed from the Store, such as IRC, no longer stops on a method the OS removed. The install check now compares exact method signatures and names the missing one.\nRelease notes: https://github.com/Kazo-ca/Os/releases/tag/v3.3.0",
